WEBVTT

00:11:29.079 --> 00:11:32.037
She also felt that the company had
a serious lack of diversity,

00:11:32.871 --> 00:11:35.996
Janice said that when she started
she was the only black employee

00:11:36.496 --> 00:11:38.496
and that did not improve much over time.

00:11:39.579 --> 00:11:44.412
But she'd invested so much in this job, so
instead of rethinking her commitment,

00:11:44.704 --> 00:11:49.496
Jannis escalated it by investing more
energy and time and stayed in the job

00:11:49.496 --> 00:11:53.787
for two more years. She told herself that
since her co-workers were reluctant

00:11:53.787 --> 00:11:56.371
to speak up, she might be able
to change the company.

00:11:56.996 --> 00:12:03.329
I'm going to be the person to, like, jump
in and make this change where others,